  "provenance": "Retained generated-support snapshot, not GNU Git blobs. SHA-256 values attest the existing bytes, not a reproduced generation. GNU generator/rule and input references below were traced at gnu_commit; original execution, toolchain and complete generation inputs are not recorded. In particular eucjp-ms uses an external glibc charmap, and subdirs.el reflects a historical local directory inventory including vendor. No claim is made that these retained outputs can be regenerated byte-for-byte from the pin alone.",
